    "name": "Kisan Saathi - Complete Platform & External APIs Collection",
    "description": "Comprehensive, exhaustive Postman Collection for Kisan Saathi (किसान साथी: फसल से लेकर बिक्री तक).\nIncludes all 52 external and internal endpoints: OGD Agmarknet, Open-Meteo Weather, Google Gemini Multimodal Vision AI, India Post Pincode, Agronomy, Mandi Marketplace, Community Chaupal, Farmer Multi-Plot & Diary Cloud Sync, and Super Admin Command Center.",
